        <activityName xml:lang="en">Diode, unspecified, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Diode, unspecified, at plant
This module represents an unweighted average of all specific diode (and LED) datasets represented in the ecoinvent database. No specific updates were made in 2023, as there is no detailed market share data.; UUID: ab54fff4-3fc8-3d6e-8261-4e1e9484a2de
This dataset covers raw material input and production efforts for the production of current diodes.
Location: Data represent global valuable composition data for diodes.
Technology: average diode production technology, comprising the diode wafer production (cleaing, masking, etching, doping, oxidising, metal deposition) and the final assembly of the diode (wafer sawing, die bonding, moulding, trimming and forming)
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: see Geography and General Comments
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ab54fff4-3fc8-3d6e-8261-4e1e9484a2de.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
